在雞胸肉背面）是隔壁桌女客人翻開雞肉之後看到的😱\n\n女客人感覺沒要跟店家反映，只是默默收起手中的筷子，作罷不吃。我非常震驚，小強什麼的有看過，就從沒見過食物裡出現長得像蠍子或蜈蚣的🤯\n\n然後我開始檢查眼前的餐點。剛剛一邊滑手機一邊吃麵，沒在注意碗裡的情況，結果低頭一看立馬發現一隻果蠅（可能好幾隻已經下肚🥹）\n\n餐點表現尚可，但同一次用餐接連看到兩碗食物出現昆蟲，實在很難讓人安心。店家的食材清洗、保存方式、廚房環境跟病媒防治都非常需要檢查跟改善。在店家提出具體改善措施之前，個人非常不建議前往消費！",null,[0,79]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/17968685291994123689/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhvYldWWVZuRmhiRmt3Vlhwa1YwNVdaRkJOTTBveFRteGtORk14UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17968685291994123689/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhvYldWWVZuRmhiRmt3Vlhwa1YwNVdaRkJOTTBveFRteGtORk14UlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/17968685291994123689/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhvYldWWVZuRmhiRmt3Vlhwa1YwNVdaRkJOTTBveFRteGtORk14UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17968685291994123689/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhvYldWWVZuRmhiRmt3Vlhwa1YwNVdaRkJOTTBveFRteGtORk14UlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/17968685291994123689/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhvYldWWVZuRmhiRmt3Vlhwa1YwNVdaRkJOTTBveFRteGtORk14UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17968685291994123689/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhvYldWWVZuRmhiRmt3Vlhwa1YwNVdaRkJOTTBveFRteGtORk14UlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,554,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xobWVYVnFhbFkwVXpkV05WZFBNM0oxTmxkNFMxRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xe5b64fef575e3d2d!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlhmeXVqalY0UzdWNVdPM3J1Nld4S1E%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xobWVYVnFhbFkwVXpkV05WZFBNM0oxTmxkNFMxRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xobWVYVnFhbFkwVXpkV05WZFBNM0oxTmxkNFMxRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xobWVYVnFhbFkwVXpkV05WZFBNM0ox